    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The location of this site is only moments away from the Promenade and Clontarf village. There is a quality bus corridor operating along the Clontarf Road providing an efficient link to the City Centre; the 130 bus route has stops in close proximity, and Clontarf Road DART Station is within walking distance. In addition to this, there are an abundance of excellent schools and sporting facilities in the immediate vicinity as well as St Anne's Park and Dollymount Strand.  \r\n \r\nFull planning permission has already been granted under planning ref: WEB1071/24. \r\n\r\nPlanning Pack available on request.  \r\n \r\nViewing at any reasonable hour. Site inspections arranged by appointment. **Please note  are permitted at viewings and a signed disclaimer is required from interested parties***"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Full Planning Permission for the construction of a 200 sq. m (2,150 sq. ft) end of terraced house in the heart of Clontarf.\r\nUnique and rare opportunity to construct your dream home\r\nPlanning Reference WEB1071/24 with Dublin City Council\r\nGuide Price €650,000"
      }
